            "review_title": "Review at Pho Xao Ba Thanh Beo",
            "review_text": "Russ Lacuata\nLong Beach, California9995 contributions\n2\nEat Like the Locals\nSep 2024 • Solo\nI always see locals eating here, they must be doing something right. Eating like locals do with a small stool as a chair and a small table.\n\nStir-fried noodles are perfectly cooked. The sliced beef is perfectly seasoned, tender, and juicy. Great full flavor. My complaint is the portion size. It's a small portion and wish that they add more beef. They give you a basket full of fresh vegetables and herbs and also crisp pickled sliced green papaya. Total cost: 90K with the lemon tea.\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2024",
